Subject: [PATCH] amlogic: preserve user HDMI timings and recover new sinks

Keep active and GUI timings across transient HPD/EDID loss, retry valid-mode
discovery, reattach inactive encoders, and allow single-mode displays. Use an
advertised fallback on a smaller monitor while preserving the GUI preference.

